If Resonance <= 0 (or small) uniformly, then Var <= R2*V1 rigorously => R2-threshold dichotomy.
V1 exact = w^3/3 - w^4/2, w=1/7-beta_k; R2 = additive energy (sum ordered-diff multiplicities^2).
